    "notes": {
        "321741d7-96f6-4430-8710-088788ebe203": {
            "x": 64,
            "y": 784,
            "width": 672,
            "height": 256,
            "content": "## ⚠️ Provokes its own events\n\nAt flow start each trigger registers an HTTP integration in Gorgias (Settings > Integrations > HTTP). The Wait gives Gorgias a minute before the flow creates a ticket (New Ticket), raises its priority (Updated Ticket) and adds an internal note (New Ticket Message). Keep the Wait. The triggers fire for every ticket of the account, so run the flow on a test helpdesk. The ticket and its customer are deleted at the end; the integrations are removed when the flow stops."
        }
    }
